{"ID":"20240314091908-fvaickw","Spec":"2","Type":"NodeDocument","Properties":{"id":"20240314091908-fvaickw","scroll":"\u0026#123;\u0026quot;rootId\u0026quot;:\u0026quot;20240314091908-fvaickw\u0026quot;,\u0026quot;startId\u0026quot;:\u0026quot;20240422165516-t9m64z8\u0026quot;,\u0026quot;endId\u0026quot;:\u0026quot;20240422165516-dikoxeh\u0026quot;,\u0026quot;scrollTop\u0026quot;:33,\u0026quot;focusId\u0026quot;:\u0026quot;20240422165516-dikoxeh\u0026quot;,\u0026quot;focusStart\u0026quot;:16,\u0026quot;focusEnd\u0026quot;:16\u0026#125;","title":"【半夏泻心汤】","type":"doc","updated":"20240422165516"},"Children":[{"ID":"20240422165516-t9m64z8","Type":"NodeHeading","HeadingLevel":2,"Properties":{"id":"20240422165516-t9m64z8","updated":"20240422165516"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"干呕、吐涎沫、头痛者，吴茱萸汤主之。呕而肠鸣，心下痞者，半夏泻心汤主之。"}]},{"ID":"20240422165516-pn7sqcj","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20240422165516-pn7sqcj","updated":"20240422165516"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeTextMark","Properties":{"style":"font-size: 24px; color: var(--b3-font-color6);"},"TextMarkType":"text strong","TextMarkTextContent":"半夏泻心汤方："},{"Type":"NodeKramdownSpanIAL","Data":"{: style=\"font-size: 24px; color: var(--b3-font-color6);\"}"}]},{"ID":"20240422165516-nhdwb05","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20240422165516-nhdwb05","updated":"20240422165516"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeTextMark","Properties":{"style":"color: var(--b3-font-color6);"},"TextMarkType":"strong text","TextMarkTextContent":"半夏半升洗、黄芩、干姜、人参甘草各三两炙、黄连一两、大枣十二枚"},{"Type":"NodeKramdownSpanIAL","Data":"{: style=\"color: var(--b3-font-color6);\"}"}]},{"ID":"20240422165516-hur9ky8","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20240422165516-hur9ky8","updated":"20240422165516"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeTextMark","Properties":{"style":"color: var(--b3-font-color6);"},"TextMarkType":"strong text","TextMarkTextContent":"右七味，以水一斗，煮取六升，去渣，再煮，取三升，温服一升，日三服。"},{"Type":"NodeKramdownSpanIAL","Data":"{: style=\"color: var(--b3-font-color6);\"}"}]},{"ID":"20240422165516-neuonba","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20240422165516-neuonba","updated":"20240422165516"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"好，我们接着看。"},{"Type":"NodeTextMark","TextMarkType":"strong","TextMarkTextContent":"干呕"},{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"，"},{"Type":"NodeTextMark","Properties":{"style":"color: var(--b3-font-color8);"},"TextMarkType":"text","TextMarkTextContent":"干呕就是感觉恶心呕吐了，但是什么东西都没有吐出来"},{"Type":"NodeKramdownSpanIAL","Data":"{: style=\"color: var(--b3-font-color8);\"}"},{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"，这是干呕。"},{"Type":"NodeTextMark","Properties":{"style":"color: var(--b3-font-color8);"},"TextMarkType":"text","TextMarkTextContent":"还有一种呢是吐涎沫，白色的痰吐出来，这两种情形，还有一种头痛，都是吴茱萸汤主之。"},{"Type":"NodeKramdownSpanIAL","Data":"{: style=\"color: var(--b3-font-color8);\"}"},{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"大家现在了解了。这个吐涎沫是因为恶心，因为上焦太寒了嘛，所以把肺里面一些津液，口水都吐出来了。这个干呕是因为胃里面是冷的，没有东西在里面嘛，所以他会干呕，也是吴茱萸汤。"}]},{"ID":"20240422165516-50exuyy","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20240422165516-50exuyy","updated":"20240422165516"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"后面你看，"},{"Type":"NodeTextMark","TextMarkType":"strong","TextMarkTextContent":"呕而肠鸣"},{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"，肚子咕噜咕噜地叫，肠子里面肠鸣声很大。"},{"Type":"NodeTextMark","TextMarkType":"strong","TextMarkTextContent":"心下痞者"},{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"，诸位在念伤寒论的时候。在张仲景就说了，当你"},{"Type":"NodeTextMark","Properties":{"style":"color: var(--b3-font-color8);"},"TextMarkType":"text","TextMarkTextContent":"有表症的时候要先解表，不能攻里"},{"Type":"NodeKramdownSpanIAL","Data":"{: style=\"color: var(--b3-font-color8);\"}"},{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"。有表症的时候你不知道，结果你一攻下，表邪下陷，"},{"Type":"NodeTextMark","Properties":{"style":"color: var(--b3-font-color8);"},"TextMarkType":"text","TextMarkTextContent":"轻者心下痞"},{"Type":"NodeKramdownSpanIAL","Data":"{: style=\"color: var(--b3-font-color8);\"}"},{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"，对不对，"},{"Type":"NodeTextMark","Properties":{"style":"color: var(--b3-font-color8);"},"TextMarkType":"text","TextMarkTextContent":"重者会变成悬饮"},{"Type":"NodeKramdownSpanIAL","Data":"{: style=\"color: var(--b3-font-color8);\"}"},{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"，包括十枣汤，甘遂半夏汤就这么来的。"}]},{"ID":"20240422165516-dem3g7y","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20240422165516-dem3g7y","updated":"20240422165516"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"心下痞我们有五个泻心汤。现在这里介绍的是半夏泻心汤。介绍泻心汤之前呢，我给诸位一个概念。"},{"Type":"NodeTextMark","Properties":{"style":"color: var(--b3-font-color8);"},"TextMarkType":"text","TextMarkTextContent":"黄芩呢，它是对胃"},{"Type":"NodeKramdownSpanIAL","Data":"{: style=\"color: var(--b3-font-color8);\"}"},{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"。所以，有胃发炎的时候，胃里面不舒服的时候，舌苔是黄的...我们看舌苔，"},{"Type":"NodeTextMark","Properties":{"style":"color: var(--b3-font-color8);"},"TextMarkType":"text","TextMarkTextContent":"舌苔也是代表胃气的所在，只要是黄的，我们就会重用黄芩"},{"Type":"NodeKramdownSpanIAL","Data":"{: style=\"color: var(--b3-font-color8);\"}"},{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"。"},{"Type":"NodeTextMark","Properties":{"style":"color: var(--b3-font-color8);"},"TextMarkType":"text","TextMarkTextContent":"到了小肠里面的时候他会肠鸣，咕噜咕噜地叫，就是黄连"},{"Type":"NodeKramdownSpanIAL","Data":"{: style=\"color: var(--b3-font-color8);\"}"},{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"。所以黄芩、黄连才会出现在同一个处方里面。呕呢，恶心，胃里面有停水，所以有肠鸣，所以我们是不是加半夏？那这个食物跟饮水吃到胃里面去了以后，胃里面太冷了，这个水跟食物一路跑到小肠里面，小肠里面也是冷的。这个时候我们加什么？干姜对不对。那病人是有呕，恶心，我们加人参、甘草、红枣把吐掉的津液补足。处方就这样来的。"}]},{"ID":"20240422165516-b2wxs5i","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20240422165516-b2wxs5i","updated":"20240422165516"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"所以当你很了解了处方的方义以后，你就会变化方剂，就很简单了。那在临床上面，我们看到这个半夏泻心汤呢，有些病人常年的下利，来找你的时候你问他你大便好不好，我们平常正常一天一次或两次最多了，哦~他六七次，这个人怎么这么多大便？因为他吃完东西就拉肚子，半夏泻心汤证。"}]},{"ID":"20240422165516-pjza38r","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20240422165516-pjza38r","updated":"20240422165516"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeTextMark","Properties":{"style":"color: var(--b3-font-color8);"},"TextMarkType":"text","TextMarkTextContent":"这个半夏泻心汤症出现的时候，一定会有腹痛，有肚子痛的现象，兼有肠鸣"},{"Type":"NodeKramdownSpanIAL","Data":"{: style=\"color: var(--b3-font-color8);\"}"},{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"。如果一个病人呢，也是"},{"Type":"NodeTextMark","Properties":{"style":"color: var(--b3-font-color8);"},"TextMarkType":"text","TextMarkTextContent":"呕，恶心，心下痞，但是他没有肠鸣，没有腹痛，就是甘草泻心汤"},{"Type":"NodeKramdownSpanIAL","Data":"{: style=\"color: var(--b3-font-color8);\"}"},{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"。我们前面有介绍过甘草泻心汤。如果是下利，肠鸣很重的人，半夏泻心汤都去不掉的时候，我们就要增加这个生姜的量。当你增加了生姜的量以后，就变成生姜泻心汤，"},{"Type":"NodeTextMark","Properties":{"style":"color: var(--b3-font-color8);"},"TextMarkType":"text","TextMarkTextContent":"生姜泻心汤专门治疗肠鸣很重的下利"},{"Type":"NodeKramdownSpanIAL","Data":"{: style=\"color: var(--b3-font-color8);\"}"},{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"，这是他一点区分的地方，这只是处方的加减。所以生姜泻心汤呢，我们到时候真的使用的时候，我们会把生姜加到五片六片七片都没有关系，他就叫生姜泻心汤，不叫干姜泻心汤，所以干姜不用加量哦"},{"Type":"NodeTextMark","Properties":{"style":"color: var(--b3-font-color8);"},"TextMarkType":"text","TextMarkTextContent":"，只增加生姜重量，为什么？因为干姜是温中的，生姜是排肠胃的水的"},{"Type":"NodeKramdownSpanIAL","Data":"{: style=\"color: var(--b3-font-color8);\"}"},{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"，因为一直下利嘛，拉肚子的时候拉出来都是水，所以要重用生姜。"}]},{"ID":"20240422165516-011f9cp","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20240422165516-011f9cp","updated":"20240422165516"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"当医生看病的时候，不要舍不得用药。我们说重用生姜，给他六片，你说生姜很贵啊，有的医生就是这样子的，很讨厌，教不起来。"}]},{"ID":"20240422165516-6vowpvz","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20240422165516-6vowpvz","updated":"20240422165516"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"处方的剂量，一般来说，我们半夏是"},{"Type":"NodeTextMark","Properties":{"style":"color: var(--b3-font-color8);"},"TextMarkType":"text","TextMarkTextContent":"五钱，黄芩、干姜三钱，人参两钱，黄连一钱或者两钱"},{"Type":"NodeKramdownSpanIAL","Data":"{: style=\"color: var(--b3-font-color8);\"}"},{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"，这都没有关系。你如果说老师，我这里胃里面心下痞，但是我没有刚刚讲的这个肠鸣，那你就把这个黄连拿掉嘛，对不对？知道我的意思吧。那病人已经在下利了，你会不会加个大黄？不会吧，这是雪上加霜，没有这种医生的哦。"}]},{"ID":"20240422165516-dikoxeh","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20240422165516-dikoxeh","updated":"20240422165516"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"那你如果说，你看下面这个处方哦。"}]}]}